<title>JAPAN: Hitachi Electronics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Electronics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 25.98		vs	   25.54</p>
<p> Operating	  364    million	  vs	  663    million</p>
<p> Current	    602    million	  vs	  766    million</p>
<p> Net		  330    million	  vs	  430    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.79 yen	  vs	    7.56 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     57 million	  vs	  57 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hitachi Electronics Ltd is an Hitachi-affiliated manufacturer of broadcasting and communications equipment.</p>
</text>
